OL,3,AJealous husband who strangled wife in
OL,4,Abed found guilty of murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA jealous husband who strangled his
OL,7,Fwife in their bed has been found guilty
OL,8,Fof murder.
OL,10,FMichael Davies, 58, killed Tracey
OL,11,FDavies at their home on Bryn Terrace in
OL,12,FCefn Cribwr, Bridgend, after wrongly
OL,13,Fsuspecting she was going to leave him.
OL,15,FDavies was jealous over his wife
OL,16,Fworking with male colleagues and he was
OL,17,Falso #30,000 in debt.
OL,19,FHe previously admitted the manslaughter
OL,20,Fof Tracey, 48, but denied murder on the
OL,21,Fgrounds of diminished responsibility.
